+## Verification commands and outputs
+
+`test -f daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/prepare_change.rs`
+
+Output: passed.
+
+`test -f daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/plan_edit.rs`
